  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Casserole.png|200px|left|Casserole]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 36\n |price = 1 to 367\n |time = 2 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|pieo|bigger|link=Pie Oven}}\n |xp = 44\n |base = 102\n |time3 = 1 h 42 min\n |dia= 5\n}}\n'''Casseroles''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 36.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making casseroles'''===\n[[File:Pie Oven.png|150px|left|Pie Oven]]\nCasseroles are made in the [[Pie Oven]].\n\nTo make a casserole, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Potato.png|75px|link=Potato|Potatoes]]\n|[[File:Bacon.png|75px|link=Bacon|Bacon]]\n|[[File:Egg.png|75px|link=Egg|Eggs]]\n|[[File:Cheese.png|75px|link=Cheese|Cheese]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 2 hours to make a casserole, and 1 hour and 42 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] oven. Each casserole gives players 44 [[experience]] points.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling casseroles'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Casseroles can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3,672 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 dishes.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a casserole costs 330 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders require 1 to 2 casseroles per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Auflauf\n|es = Gratinado de beicon\n|fr = Gratin de Patates\n|it = Gratin de Patates\n|nl = Ovenschotel\n|no = Gryterett\n|zh = Casserole\n}}\n[[pt-br:Caçarola]]\n[[ru:Запеканка]]\n[[Category:Pie Oven Products]]\n[[Category:Egg Products]]\n[[Category:Bacon Products]]\n[[Category:Cheese Products]]\n[[Category:Potato Products]]",
